WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:07.840
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going to&nbsp;
explain a Hong Kong–Chinese culinary drama film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:15.920
called “Cook Up a Storm.” Spoilers&nbsp;
ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:22.000
The movie centers around a famous local&nbsp;
restaurant named the Seven, in Spring Avenue&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.240
Hong Kong. The talented chef of the restaurant,&nbsp;
Sky Ko, specializes in southern-style cuisine.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:34.160
A TV host features the thirty-year-old restaurant&nbsp;
and its chef on a culinary program. Sky shows his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:39.280
talent on national television, even though he is&nbsp;
already popular as the best chef in all of Spring&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:45.280
Avenue. Alongside him, his friend Uni is also&nbsp;
introduced to the people. She usually manages&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:50.720
the financial aspect of the restaurant. Sky is&nbsp;
very definitive about the quality of food and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:55.840
time they provide to their customers which is part&nbsp;
of the reason why their restaurant is so popular.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.840 --> 00:01:00.960
Most of the time, it is so packed that a queue of&nbsp;
people has to line up outside the restaurant.
&nbsp;

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:07.280
That day, a rude customer barges in after breaking&nbsp;
the queue. Sky refuses to serve him even though&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:12.640
the customer boasts about the power and money&nbsp;
he possesses. Before leaving, the man laughs at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:18.640
their small restaurant and discloses that his&nbsp;
boss has invited a world-class chef to open a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:24.640
three-star restaurant opposite theirs. The thought&nbsp;
scares Uni but she dismisses it as a bluff. 
&nbsp;

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:30.160
Meanwhile, in France, the crowned king and queen&nbsp;
are welcoming their newborn son. They hold a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:35.520
massive ball to celebrate the birth and invite a&nbsp;
world-class chef to cook for the guests. We are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:41.760
introduced to the said chef, Paul Ahn. He is a&nbsp;
Michelin-starred Korean chef trained in France.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:46.720
Paul has a special way of cooking that doesn’t&nbsp;
see boundaries in one particular style. He loves&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:52.480
to mix cuisines from different countries and hence&nbsp;
create innovative dishes. For the chef’s special,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:57.760
he presents the queen with a dessert that looks&nbsp;
like a red egg but is filled with mango puree&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:03.280
and coconuts. The dish is inspired by the&nbsp;
tradition that symbolizes red eggs as a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:07.920
blessing to the newborn. The delicious dish&nbsp;
and the meaning behind it touch the royals’&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:13.200
hearts and they applaud Paul’s brilliant work. 
After the successful ball, he and his assistant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:17.920
Mayo return to the restaurant that they currently&nbsp;
work in. The owner and their co-workers welcome&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:23.040
them with cheers, congratulating them on their&nbsp;
success. The owner also announces that they have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:29.120
promoted Paul to the executive chef of the whole&nbsp;
Art Nouveau franchise. The step is a huge one for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:35.520
him; however, to everyone’s surprise, he declines&nbsp;
the offer. Paul wants to return to Asia and pursue&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:41.120
a bigger and higher ambition. He and Mayo have&nbsp;
been invited by a Chinese businessman who wants to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:41.120 --> 00:02:46.080
open a three-star restaurant. The staff supports&nbsp;
their decision and wishes them farewell. 
&nbsp;

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:50.640
Back in Spring Avenue, one of Sky’s regular&nbsp;
customers informs him that the rumor about a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:56.080
new restaurant being established is true. The&nbsp;
news is bittersweet for Sky because he wants&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.080 --> 00:03:02.080
his small colony to develop, but a new restaurant&nbsp;
would mean fewer customers and more competition.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:08.240
When Sky was ten years old, his father used to hit&nbsp;
him and insult him for having no talent as a cook.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:13.760
One day, he abandoned Sky and chose to pursue&nbsp;
his culinary career over being a father&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:22.640
with the excuse that Sky couldn’t even make a&nbsp;
decent bowl of noodles. Ever since, Uncle Seven,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:26.880
the master and owner of the Seven&nbsp;
restaurants, has taken care of him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:32.240
He also taught Sky everything that he needed to&nbsp;
know about food, unlike his father. Currently,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:37.280
Sky hasn't met his father in over twenty years&nbsp;
and has no plan to reconcile with him.
&nbsp;

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:41.680
The following morning, Paul arrives in Hong&nbsp;
Kong and goes to the market in search of a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:46.880
big grouper fish. The seller only has one&nbsp;
of such and decides to sell it to Sky,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:52.160
knowing that he will cook it better. Paul argues,&nbsp;
insisting that a shopkeeper shouldn’t be biased.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:55.680
They get into a small argument before&nbsp;
the seller cuts the fish in half&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.680 --> 00:04:00.640
for both of them. A few weeks later is the&nbsp;
opening ceremony of the three-star restaurant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:05.760
named Stellar that is right in front of the Seven&nbsp;
restaurant. The chairman and manager of the Li&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:12.080
Management Group arrive as the first guests of the&nbsp;
restaurant and are welcomed by Paul and Mayo.
&nbsp;

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:15.920
At the same time, the people from the Seven&nbsp;
restaurant start announcing about different&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:20.240
discount offers they are offering for the next&nbsp;
week. When the security guards from the Stellar&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:25.520
restaurant try to stop them, a conflict arises.&nbsp;
This attracts Paul and the guests’ attention,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.520 --> 00:04:29.760
making them come out to see what the fuss&nbsp;
is about. When the conversation gets heated,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:35.520
Mayo suggests they hold a competition to see which&nbsp;
cook is better. Sky and Paul recognize each other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:40.480
from the market and accept the challenge. They&nbsp;
decide to indulge in a fish cutting competition.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:46.080
Paul goes first and skilfully picks all the&nbsp;
ribs of a fish in no time Following that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:51.440
Sky takes the same fish and cuts it into even&nbsp;
pieces in under a minute. The crowd claps for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:56.320
him and even Paul is impressed. The chairman of&nbsp;
the Li group has to announce the results. 
&nbsp;

00:04:56.320 --> 00:05:00.640
In an unbiased way, he claims that the&nbsp;
true results will only be announced in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.640 --> 00:05:06.080
International Chef Challenge Competition that both&nbsp;
chefs have taken part in. He also announces that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:11.200
he is planning to take over the entire Spring&nbsp;
Avenue colony to remove all the buildings and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:16.560
modernize it. If Sky wins in the competition,&nbsp;
the chairman is willing to withdraw his plan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.560 --> 00:05:22.400
to preserve the heritage of the colony. However,&nbsp;
if Paul wins, he will go through with the plan.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:28.240
With the future of the entire colony in his hands,&nbsp;
Sky feels pressured, still, he is determined to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:33.360
do his best. For the next few days, the number&nbsp;
of customers at the Seven restaurant decreases.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:39.040
Uni is worried that might soon go out of business&nbsp;
but Sky assures her that is not possible. He gives&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:43.760
her an example of escargots and field snails,&nbsp;
claiming that there will always be people who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:47.680
like one more than the other. They do not&nbsp;
have to change their food to be better than&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:51.760
the Stellar restaurant, because there will&nbsp;
always be customers who like one better. 
&nbsp;

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:56.720
The following day, Sky is met with disappointment&nbsp;
when he goes to the market and finds out the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:56.720 --> 00:06:00.880
Stellar restaurant has bought all the good&nbsp;
fish. The day is frustrating for the workers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:05.600
in the Seven restaurant until they find out&nbsp;
that Sky has been selected for the culinary&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:10.800
competition. He will soon go against Paul to&nbsp;
be selected for the semi-finals. But then,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:16.080
it is also announced that the victor will have to&nbsp;
go against the two-time winner of the competition,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:21.680
Mountain Ko. Sky is shocked to see that his&nbsp;
father has achieved the success he wanted to.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:26.400
He is now even more determined to reach&nbsp;
the finals and compete against him.
&nbsp;

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:31.520
That night, uncle Seven returns home from his&nbsp;
trip and calls Sky to a pub. Excited to meet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:31.520 --> 00:06:36.560
him after long, Sky runs to the location&nbsp;
but finds his father with uncle Seven.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:41.120
Mountain bluntly says that he still doesn’t&nbsp;
believe in Sky and doesn’t regret leaving him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:41.120 --> 00:06:46.480
for his career. The words are the most hurtful&nbsp;
thing Sky has ever heard but he hides his pain&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.480 --> 00:06:51.440
with anger. He promises to win the competition&nbsp;
and prove that being a good cook doesn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:56.880
require being a bad person like Mountain is. 
On the day of the culinary duel, the contestants&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:56.880 --> 00:07:01.680
get ninety minutes to cook a dish of their&nbsp;
choice and present it. Sky makes a traditional&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:07.520
salt-baked duck while Paul makes a foie gras&nbsp;
sorbet. The entire ninety minutes are intense&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:07.520 --> 00:07:12.720
as both cooks show great expertise while cooking&nbsp;
their respective dishes. Sky cuts the duck’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:17.920
inside with little to no effort and pulls it&nbsp;
out efficiently, making the audience gasp. 
&nbsp;

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:23.520
In the end, he bakes the duck in salt and breaks&nbsp;
the additional layer to reveal a well-cooked duck&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:28.640
with vegetable stuffings. The judges try it&nbsp;
and seem to be more impressed by Sky’s duck&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:34.480
than Paul’s sorbet. When it is time to vote, Paul&nbsp;
receives three 9s and a whopping 10 out of 10,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:34.480 --> 00:07:40.080
scoring a total of thirty-seven points. Right&nbsp;
after, Sky receives two 10s from the first two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:45.040
judges. The third one gives him nine but&nbsp;
the last judge only gives him an eight.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:45.040 --> 00:07:49.840
Because both chefs tied in points, the head&nbsp;
judge makes the executive decision to make&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:49.840 --> 00:07:54.880
Paul the winner because his dish presentation&nbsp;
was superior to Sky's bland plating. 
&nbsp;

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:58.320
Although Paul’s victory should've&nbsp;
solidified his abilities as a cook,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:58.320 --> 00:08:03.280
things do not go as expected. While celebrating&nbsp;
their victory, the manager informs Paul that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:08.320
wants to replace him with Mayo to compete in the&nbsp;
finals. According to him, a woman is far more&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:13.440
appealing in the media than a man. When Paul&nbsp;
tries to defend his position as head chef, Mayo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:19.200
exposes that he has difficulty tasting certain&nbsp;
flavors like saltiness. For the past few months,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:24.560
he has been using a notebook containing all his&nbsp;
recipes to cook and can do nothing on his own.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:29.600
Mayo also discloses that she never wanted to&nbsp;
befriend Paul and only sided with him to surpass&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:35.600
him as a chef. Betrayed and hurt, Paul storms&nbsp;
out of the restaurant to never look back. 
&nbsp;

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:40.400
That night, Sky bumps into a drunk Paul in&nbsp;
front of an event stadium. They forget about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:45.360
their rivalry for a few minutes and share their&nbsp;
past and troubles. Paul reveals that his father&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:51.760
was a great chef and his dying wish was for Paul&nbsp;
to be like him. Sky also tells him about his and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:57.280
mountain’s relationship. After the conversation,&nbsp;
they find mutual respect for each other. They also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:57.280 --> 00:09:02.240
throw bottles of alcohol at Mountain’s picture on&nbsp;
a billboard while cursing at him in Korean. 
&nbsp;

00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:06.640
Paul doesn’t want to give up on the competition&nbsp;
yet. Since he cannot take part as a representative&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:11.120
of the Stellar restaurant, he decides to&nbsp;
participate as an individual chef after&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:11.120 --> 00:09:16.720
debunking the rule book. He even asks Sky to&nbsp;
join him for the semi-finals. At the same time,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:21.920
the manager of Stellar is at the Seven restaurant&nbsp;
urging Uncle Seven to sign away his restaurant to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:27.680
the Li group. Right then, Paul and Sky appear and&nbsp;
announce their partnership. Paul also reminds the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:27.680 --> 00:09:32.560
manager that as the winner of the competition, he&nbsp;
is eligible to compete at the championship. 
&nbsp;

00:09:32.560 --> 00:09:37.120
For the next few weeks, Sky and Paul work&nbsp;
and train together. They try each other’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:42.000
style of cooking and reach a common ground&nbsp;
of modernization of traditional cuisine. 
&nbsp;

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:46.960
The semi-final of the Culinary Competition&nbsp;
takes place at the Studio City Casino in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:52.400
Macau. The one to win the round will have to&nbsp;
face the current God of Cookery, Mountain Ko.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:57.680
The competition starts and Sky and Paul use both&nbsp;
their culinary strengths to compete against four&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:57.680 --> 00:10:03.040
other great chefs from different parts of the&nbsp;
world. Somehow, the Li group has also made Mayo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:08.240
take part in the competition. She cooks extra&nbsp;
carefully to prove that she is better than Paul.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:08.240 --> 00:10:13.680
She makes an oyster dish with frozen foam that&nbsp;
the judges compliment initially, but on being&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:18.720
served, they seem to find it mediocre.  
Meanwhile, Paul and Sky create a deconstructed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:23.520
mapo tofu. Sky's sense of taste helps determine&nbsp;
the flavor of the ingredients while Paul’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:23.520 --> 00:10:28.640
understanding of the culinary artistry helps&nbsp;
with the techniques and processes used. Together,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:34.640
they create a traditional dish with a modern&nbsp;
design. The judges complement the dish in detail,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:34.640 --> 00:10:39.680
thoroughly impressed by it. In the end, they&nbsp;
win the competition and reach the finale.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:44.720
As everyone cheers, Paul looks at Mayo who&nbsp;
stands with her head low, ashamed that she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:49.600
betrayed him and couldn’t prove herself.
For the final round, only one of the chefs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:49.600 --> 00:10:54.320
can compete against Mountain. Paul thinks that&nbsp;
because of his lack of taste, he is ineligible&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:59.920
to participate. He also knows that Sky's desire&nbsp;
to beat Mountain is a very personal one, hence he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:05.600
suggests Sky face Mountain in the finals. 
The following day, Sky stands face to face&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:09.760
with his father. The competition asks&nbsp;
them to cook anything they want in an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:14.000
hour. The father and son do not share&nbsp;
words before the competition starts.
&nbsp;

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:18.320
Mountain immediately begins to cook&nbsp;
but Sky is distracted by his thoughts.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:23.120
He remembers how Mountain abandoned him and how&nbsp;
much the people in the neighborhood mean to him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:28.000
The thoughts overwhelm Sky and he can hardly&nbsp;
focus. To get him to come back to his senses,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:33.040
Mountain splashes water at his son's face.
The action brings Sky back and he immediately&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:38.240
starts making dough. By the end of the hour,&nbsp;
Mountain makes an aesthetic sugar display of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:45.040
molten lava with a flower on top. In contrast,&nbsp;
Sky's dish is a bit more simple but personal. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:50.320
makes noodles, like the noodles that Mountain&nbsp;
made years ago before abandoning his son. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:55.840
judges try Mountain’s dish and are impressed by&nbsp;
it. However, Sky never hands his dish to them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:56.400 --> 00:12:01.840
Instead, he gives the bowl of noodles to&nbsp;
Mountain. Mountain eats it and is moved&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:06.800
as he remembers what the noodles represent.&nbsp;
At last, he has no choice but to acknowledge&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:12.000
his son’s brilliance in culinary art. The&nbsp;
winner of the competition is unclear because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:16.400
the judges never got to taste the food.
In the following scene, we see a crowd has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:21.840
gathered outside the Seven restaurant to celebrate&nbsp;
the Chinese new year. They enjoy a meal cooked by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:26.800
Sky and Paul together as a family. 
